  info                     : "This policy setting determines which users can bypass file, directory, registry, and other persistent object permissions when restoring backed up files and directories on systems that run Windows Vista (or newer)."
  solution                 : 'To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Administrators :

Computer Configuration\\Policies\\Windows Settings\\Security Settings\\Local Policies\\User Rights Assignment\\Restore files and directories

