<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0314 - MSSRV - Ensure 'Network access: Sharing and security model for local accounts' is set to 'Classic - local users authenticate as themselves'"
  info                     : "This policy setting determines how network logons that use local accounts are authenticated."
  solution                 : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Classic - local users authenticate as themselves :

Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\Security Options\Network access: Sharing and security model for local accounts

Impact:

None - this is the default configuration for domain-joined computers."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-6b."
  see_also                 : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
  value_type               : POLICY_DWORD
